WEBVTT

00:02.690 --> 00:05.440
The moon looks impressive tonight.

00:05.710 --> 00:08.470
Traveling on moonlit nights is quite nice.

00:10.050 --> 00:13.800
If only I could hear the 
young master's voice.

00:14.370 --> 00:17.580
I thought you wanted to surprise 
him by learning to cook.

00:17.580 --> 00:19.480
Where are you headed?

00:19.830 --> 00:21.980
To the port town of Koran.

00:21.980 --> 00:28.380
I thought I'd acquire the seaweed and kelp 
used in the Japanese dishes he likes.

00:28.380 --> 00:30.640
How admirable.

00:31.110 --> 00:35.840
Tomoe-san, aren't you going to investigate the 
site of the battle against the Dragon Slayer?

00:36.170 --> 00:41.420
Yes. Apparently a massive lake 
formed after their battle.

00:41.420 --> 00:43.490
I must investigate the reason.

00:43.810 --> 00:46.440
Then we'll both be lonely for a while.

00:46.440 --> 00:51.940
Shiki reported that the young 
master has arrived in Rotsgard.

00:52.410 --> 00:55.770
Once things settle down there, 
they'll be able to return to the demiplane.

00:56.150 --> 00:58.200
So until that time...

00:58.200 --> 00:59.870
We must be patient.

01:23.970 --> 01:26.520
<b>Season Two</b>

02:31.000 --> 02:35.380
<b></b>Central City of Rotsgard

02:31.000 --> 02:35.380
<b></b>Central City of Rotsgard

02:32.300 --> 02:36.460
Ooh... There's a wide variety 
of shops and goods.

02:36.550 --> 02:40.430
<b>Night Four    Why Am I a Teacher?!</b>

02:36.550 --> 02:40.430
<b>Night Four    Why Am I a Teacher?!</b>

02:36.820 --> 02:40.430
I'm sure business here is quite competitive.

02:40.670 --> 02:44.960
You're right. We'll start by walking 
around town to gather information.

02:46.350 --> 02:47.700
What are they doing?

02:47.700 --> 02:49.810
Extorting her, perhaps?

02:50.030 --> 02:51.820
Hyumans persecuting hyumans, huh?

02:51.820 --> 02:53.900
It's not uncommon.

02:53.900 --> 02:55.930
There are few demihumans in cities.

02:56.300 --> 03:02.060
Hyumans generally act like they're the 
only victims in situations like these,

03:02.470 --> 03:04.780
but the look in her eyes seems more...

03:05.190 --> 03:09.130
Cold? Like she's given up? 
No, that's not right.

03:09.710 --> 03:11.800
I'm a bit curious.

03:12.210 --> 03:13.330
Young Master?

03:13.630 --> 03:15.340
No, I just—

03:15.670 --> 03:17.330
I'm in a hurry.

03:17.740 --> 03:19.050
Excuse me.

03:22.050 --> 03:24.020
Wait! Listen to me!

03:24.020 --> 03:25.320
Don't be rude!

03:26.760 --> 03:29.090
<i>That's enough.</i>

03:29.360 --> 03:31.610
Are you insulting us?

03:31.610 --> 03:32.820
<i>They don't even notice me.</i>

03:31.980 --> 03:33.660
Who do you think you are?

03:33.660 --> 03:35.740
Apologize to Ilum-san.

03:35.740 --> 03:39.650
You there. Isn't that enough?

03:39.650 --> 03:40.820
<i>Why was that a question?</i>

03:41.770 --> 03:43.120
Who are you?

03:43.120 --> 03:46.000
Can't you see these clothes?

03:46.000 --> 03:47.570
Are you two idiots?

03:47.570 --> 03:48.510
<i>Their clothes?</i>

03:48.510 --> 03:52.170
<i>I think those are Rotsgard Academy uniforms.</i>

03:53.080 --> 03:56.280
<i>If I were with Tomoe or Mio...</i>

03:56.280 --> 03:58.790
Young Master, may we kill them?

03:59.150 --> 04:01.100
<i>But Shiki...</i>

04:01.100 --> 04:03.520
<i>Young Master, may I kill them?</i>

04:03.520 --> 04:04.980
<i>Shiki?!</i>

04:04.980 --> 04:06.840
<i>They dare to call me an idiot?</i>

04:06.840 --> 04:10.320
<i>Or were they calling you one?</i>

04:10.320 --> 04:12.730
<i>They must all die.</i>

04:12.730 --> 04:15.720
<i>W-Wait. Don't jump straight to murder.</i>

04:15.720 --> 04:19.060
<i>I see. Shall I inflict the 
greatest pain upon them first?</i>

04:19.270 --> 04:22.790
<i>No! Just convince them to leave.</i>

04:22.790 --> 04:24.160
<i>Very well.</i>

04:25.020 --> 04:26.740
Look at them. They're scared.

04:27.300 --> 04:30.870
I must speak with this woman.
 Stay out of my way.

04:32.140 --> 04:33.470
Listen, boys.

04:33.470 --> 04:35.840
Just get out of here. 
I promise I won't kill you.

04:35.840 --> 04:36.480
Wha—

04:36.480 --> 04:38.280
Y-You can't be serious!

04:38.280 --> 04:40.290
<i>He's totally picking a fight with them.</i>

04:40.520 --> 04:42.290
Don't get ahead of yourself.

04:42.290 --> 04:45.060
Supreme beauty who watches 
over us from the heavens,

04:43.900 --> 04:45.440
<i>Wind magic, huh?</i>

04:45.060 --> 04:48.100
make us incarnations of those 
who serve the noble one.

04:45.940 --> 04:48.100
<i>I can't use that element, but...</i>

04:49.470 --> 04:51.580
<i>What? Why are they floating?</i>

04:51.580 --> 04:52.970
<i>At such low altitude, too.</i>

04:54.000 --> 04:56.380
He's surprised by our floating spell.

04:56.820 --> 04:58.690
<i>Um, aren't you going to attack?</i>

04:58.690 --> 05:00.680
<i>What's the point of making 
me watch you float?</i>

05:03.470 --> 05:05.890
<i>You're provoking them as well, Young Master.</i>

05:05.890 --> 05:07.320
<i>That wasn't my intention!</i>

05:08.120 --> 05:11.980
Beings of the earth, obey my 
command and take new form.

05:17.740 --> 05:19.420
Huh? What?

05:19.420 --> 05:20.540
<i>Aw, man.</i>

05:20.780 --> 05:22.980
<i>Shiki, I'm going to get rid of these.</i>

05:22.980 --> 05:25.280
<i>They should be fine since they're floating.</i>

05:26.590 --> 05:30.790
<i>Impressive. Soon, you'll have 
mastered counterspelling, too.</i>

05:30.790 --> 05:33.440
<i>Dispelling an ally's spell 
is hardly impressive.</i>

05:33.880 --> 05:35.940
<i>I still can't use it in a fight.</i>

05:37.760 --> 05:39.950
<i>Can you read?</i>

05:39.950 --> 05:42.390
<i>If you're okay, I'd appreciate it if you fled.</i>

05:42.390 --> 05:44.900
N-Nobody asked for your help.

05:45.450 --> 05:47.580
<i>I'm not trying to make you indebted to me.</i>

05:47.580 --> 05:49.250
<i>You're welcome to forget this ever happened.</i>

05:53.960 --> 05:58.630
Um, I'm a waitress at the 
Gotetsu Restaurant up ahead.

05:59.140 --> 06:01.670
If you stop by, I can thank you there.

06:02.030 --> 06:04.190
We serve excellent hot pot dishes.

06:04.190 --> 06:06.370
Hot pot, huh?

06:06.370 --> 06:09.000
Let's head there later regardless.

06:09.230 --> 06:13.820
Anyway, that girl was rather 
rude despite us saving her.

06:13.820 --> 06:14.480
Was she?

06:15.020 --> 06:19.150
I can see why she'd be suspicious of someone 
rescuing her for nothing in return.

06:19.150 --> 06:21.640
We put on quite the show, too.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.890
Wait a minute. Those guys...

06:25.230 --> 06:26.870
We're gonna fall!

06:25.770 --> 06:27.350
Don't run out of mana!

06:27.730 --> 06:30.800
Eventually they'll exhaust 
their mana and fall.

06:30.800 --> 06:33.950
I hope they'll be happy in their next lives.

06:34.520 --> 06:35.960
Help them.

06:37.430 --> 06:39.030
Very well.

06:44.750 --> 06:45.890
<i>He dropped them.</i>

06:47.110 --> 06:49.100
<i>How childish.</i>

06:50.340 --> 06:51.520
Luria...

06:54.150 --> 06:55.920
You'll pay for this!

06:57.020 --> 06:58.180
Ilum-san!

06:57.440 --> 06:58.470
Wait for us!

06:59.350 --> 07:04.240
Young Master, that kind of 
thing will always happen.

07:04.240 --> 07:06.850
I'm not sure getting involved 
is the right choice.

07:07.360 --> 07:09.890
I know that, but...

07:10.790 --> 07:13.540
The look in her eyes made me curious.

07:14.160 --> 07:17.250
Then forgive me for being presumptuous.

07:19.000 --> 07:21.090
Now, let's find an inn.

07:21.490 --> 07:24.380
The entrance exam is in three days, right?

07:24.380 --> 07:24.920
What?

07:25.340 --> 07:28.650
You're planning to take the entrance exam?

07:28.650 --> 07:32.140
I need to enter the academy to be recognized

07:32.140 --> 07:36.630
as a resident of this town and receive 
permission to open a new store.

07:37.220 --> 07:41.780
But the test you're taking isn't 
the new student entrance exam.

07:41.780 --> 07:43.730
It's the teacher employment examination.

07:44.520 --> 07:45.280
What?

07:45.960 --> 07:49.600
What's the teacher employment examination?

07:49.600 --> 07:52.280
It's the test you must 
take to become a teacher.

07:52.680 --> 07:58.300
It clearly says "teacher employment 
examination" on this document from Rembrandt.

07:58.720 --> 08:01.800
R-Rembrandt-san?!

08:02.920 --> 08:07.300
Kuzunoha-dono should be 
arriving in Rotsgard soon.

08:10.190 --> 08:11.470
What is it, Morris?

08:11.700 --> 08:15.600
I've been struggling to 
read fine print recently.

08:16.170 --> 08:18.470
Perhaps I'm getting old.

08:18.470 --> 08:21.920
I have no trouble at all 
with familiar words, but...

08:23.130 --> 08:28.010
You should get some reading glasses 
before you make a mistake.

08:28.010 --> 08:29.160
I'll do that.

08:29.980 --> 08:31.950
<i>Too late.</i>

08:32.630 --> 08:35.990
<i>And then, on the day of the teacher 
employment examination...</i>

08:36.520 --> 08:37.430
It's time.

08:37.430 --> 08:39.160
I'm so nervous.

08:39.160 --> 08:41.660
Young Master, are you all right?

08:41.940 --> 08:45.670
<i>Shiki, could you call me Kuzunoha here?</i>

08:45.670 --> 08:47.750
Very well, Kuzunoha-sama.

08:48.120 --> 08:52.680
<i>Honestly, I would've run away if 
Rembrandt-san hadn't recommended me.</i>

08:52.680 --> 08:55.440
Kuzunoha Makoto-san, huh?

08:55.440 --> 08:57.400
Allow me to explain the test.

08:57.400 --> 08:59.120
<i>I'm sorry, but before that...</i>

08:59.120 --> 09:00.550
What? Writing?

09:00.550 --> 09:03.790
<i>I know this is the teacher exam,</i>

09:03.790 --> 09:06.920
<i>but are you looking to fill 
any other clerical positions?</i>

09:08.430 --> 09:10.660
That's not a request we can accommodate.

09:11.070 --> 09:14.210
Lately, a lot of people have been 
trying to apply for other positions

09:14.210 --> 09:17.360
despite us clearly stating 
we're hiring teachers.

09:17.360 --> 09:20.320
Though I suppose you can't 
help it, given your appearance.

09:17.360 --> 09:20.320
<i>The complaints and insults keep coming...</i>

09:20.800 --> 09:25.910
Looking for a backdoor because you 
can't apply normally won't...

09:25.910 --> 09:26.880
Huh?

09:26.880 --> 09:28.120
<i>Crap!</i>

09:28.370 --> 09:29.980
<i>That's not a smile!</i>

09:30.460 --> 09:33.190
Wither, you worthless wooden fool.

09:37.560 --> 09:39.250
<i>Shiki, calm down!</i>

09:39.990 --> 09:42.020
<i>Forgive my friend.</i>

09:42.370 --> 09:44.760
<i>If there aren't any clerical
positions, that's fine.</i>

09:44.760 --> 09:47.850
How can you act like nothing's 
wrong after that ridiculousness?

09:47.850 --> 09:49.140
"That ridiculousness"?!

09:49.140 --> 09:53.890
How much do you think you insulted my master 
and made him listen to your ridiculous whining?!

09:51.940 --> 09:53.890
<i>Please stop!</i>

09:54.150 --> 09:55.760
Excuse me.

09:56.710 --> 10:02.530
Allow me to apologize for 
that employee's behavior.

10:02.920 --> 10:05.450
You're offering an apology?

10:05.450 --> 10:06.410
Of course.

10:06.910 --> 10:11.880
Hurling complaints or rude language 
at an examinee is unacceptable,

10:12.350 --> 10:18.500
even if he inappropriately asked if 
we were hiring clerical employees.

10:18.760 --> 10:24.580
My master simply asked if you had any 
openings available for clerical employees.

10:24.580 --> 10:26.940
That should be understandable.

10:26.940 --> 10:30.350
We appreciate that you shared 
your valuable opinion.

10:30.350 --> 10:33.340
Now, regarding Kuzunoha-sama's exam...

10:35.760 --> 10:38.030
General tactics, is it?

10:38.760 --> 10:40.410
How would you like to take your test?

10:40.780 --> 10:43.520
You're allowed to choose your ratio of 
practical versus written assessment.

10:43.520 --> 10:45.030
<i>Um...</i>

10:45.250 --> 10:48.910
Oh, you have a recommendation from 
the Rembrandt Trading Company.

10:49.330 --> 10:52.060
You must be quite accomplished.

10:52.060 --> 10:54.000
<i>She's </i>not<i> trying to provoke me?</i>

10:54.360 --> 10:56.860
So, what will it be?

10:56.860 --> 10:59.210
Since you're applying to 
teach general tactics,

10:59.210 --> 11:02.030
would you like to focus 
on practical assessment?

11:01.280 --> 11:03.310
<i>Uh, um...</i>

11:03.750 --> 11:04.520
This one.

11:04.520 --> 11:05.120
Huh?

11:05.120 --> 11:06.060
<i>Shiki?!</i>

11:06.900 --> 11:09.020
Are you sure?

11:09.240 --> 11:15.060
Of course. As only a few have passed 
this incredibly difficult test,

11:15.390 --> 11:17.930
we shall take a practical-only assessment!

11:17.930 --> 11:19.410
<i>Incredibly difficult?</i>

11:19.700 --> 11:22.480
<i>But I'm the one who has to take the test...</i>

11:25.870 --> 11:27.880
The exam will take place over three days.

11:28.610 --> 11:32.820
The examinees will now make 
their way to the testing area.

11:32.820 --> 11:34.870
As for the equipment you were given,

11:34.870 --> 11:37.990
use the feather-shaped item 
when you wish to return,

11:37.990 --> 11:41.780
and use the bell-shaped item 
if you wish to drop out.

11:41.780 --> 11:43.310
Were two separate items really necessary?

11:43.960 --> 11:47.260
Only fighting between 
examinees is forbidden.

11:47.260 --> 11:50.910
However, since you'll be 
separated by physical distance,

11:50.910 --> 11:53.640
I doubt you'll come across one another.

11:54.510 --> 11:57.090
We can provide you with weapons,

11:57.090 --> 12:00.070
but you must procure food and 
other supplies on your own.

12:00.410 --> 12:03.780
Monsters live in the testing 
area, so do be careful.

12:03.780 --> 12:05.960
<i>So it's like a survival game.</i>

12:06.580 --> 12:12.200
Everyone who meets the conditions 
will pass the test, which are...

12:13.690 --> 12:16.840
These red, blue, and yellow 
orbs travel at high speeds.

12:16.840 --> 12:22.560
Return to the academy within three days 
with three of the three types of orbs.

12:22.820 --> 12:24.260
That's all.

12:24.260 --> 12:26.290
<i>Well, that's simple.</i>

12:26.620 --> 12:30.890
Instructions for capturing the orbs are 
included with the items given to you.

12:31.180 --> 12:34.040
Good luck, everyone.

12:38.050 --> 12:39.810
So this is the testing area.

12:40.080 --> 12:42.340
<i>First, Investigative Kai.</i>

12:44.150 --> 12:44.920
<i>Good.</i>

12:45.960 --> 12:48.150
<i>I don't have to worry about water or food.</i>

12:48.720 --> 12:53.310
<i>Compared to the wasteland I was first 
dropped into, this place is paradise.</i>

12:54.990 --> 12:58.720
<i>Looks like the other examinees 
are pretty far away.</i>

13:04.640 --> 13:06.610
<i>Okay, found an orb.</i>

13:07.180 --> 13:08.590
Let's see...

13:08.590 --> 13:14.470
"Each orb can be damaged using 
the specified attacks."

13:14.860 --> 13:18.900
"After taking enough damage, orbs will 
stop moving and can be captured."

13:18.900 --> 13:23.340
"If attacked using methods other than the 
ones specified, the orbs will burst."

13:23.940 --> 13:27.900
So only physical attacks are 
effective against the red orb.

13:28.510 --> 13:29.790
<i>I'll start with something gentle.</i>

13:34.860 --> 13:35.670
Huh?

13:36.320 --> 13:39.200
What? I didn't get the color wrong, did I?

13:40.360 --> 13:42.930
L-Let me pull myself together.

13:43.350 --> 13:46.880
Only magic attacks are effective 
against yellow, so...

13:47.190 --> 13:48.200
<i>Brid.</i>

13:52.570 --> 13:53.790
Huh?

13:55.420 --> 13:58.180
Only ranged attacks are effective 
against the blue orb.

13:58.470 --> 14:00.760
Even with a borrowed bow, 
this should be easy.

14:03.550 --> 14:04.640
Why?

14:07.920 --> 14:11.230
<i>Are my attacks doing too much damage?</i>

14:11.230 --> 14:14.580
<i>Come to think of it, I'm constantly under 
the effect of a strengthening spell.</i>

14:14.880 --> 14:16.440
<i>I should remove that.</i>

14:18.970 --> 14:20.500
A red orb.

14:23.330 --> 14:24.180
What?!

14:24.820 --> 14:27.170
Why?!

14:30.150 --> 14:33.170
<i>I failed to capture a single one, 
and I'm sleeping under the stars.</i>

14:34.660 --> 14:37.980
I'll erect a barrier that's 
pretty painful when touched.

14:44.220 --> 14:45.150
Huh?

14:46.090 --> 14:47.230
Monsters...

14:47.770 --> 14:49.580
Heave-ho!

14:55.430 --> 14:57.820
<i>I wonder what the other examinees are up to.</i>

15:00.160 --> 15:02.640
<i>Huh? The elf is missing.</i>

15:02.640 --> 15:04.640
<i>Did he finish in just one day?</i>

15:05.070 --> 15:08.570
<i>It's not a race, but I feel 
like I need to hurry.</i>

15:15.180 --> 15:18.090
I'll start with the blue orb 
susceptible to ranged attacks.

15:18.090 --> 15:21.230
I'll try grazing it with just the fletching.

15:21.510 --> 15:23.870
A feather touch, if you will.

15:27.620 --> 15:30.970
<i>I distracted myself. I'll refocus, and...</i>

15:34.870 --> 15:36.110
<i>All right. Just what I wanted.</i>

15:37.660 --> 15:38.460
What?

15:38.460 --> 15:40.360
No one said anything 
about them disappearing!

15:44.280 --> 15:45.550
It teleported?

15:45.550 --> 15:48.540
Oh, come on!

15:48.540 --> 15:51.450
<i>Okay, I'll burn this entire 
testing area down.</i>

15:53.150 --> 15:55.180
<i>No, wait. Calm down.</i>

15:56.070 --> 15:59.750
<i>I'll project the object I perceived 
with my Kai inside myself, and...</i>

16:00.930 --> 16:01.890
<i>I see it.</i>

16:10.600 --> 16:13.700
Yes! I did it!

16:15.890 --> 16:17.760
<i>Someone else disappeared.</i>

16:17.760 --> 16:19.370
<i>It was the hyuman this time.</i>

16:19.950 --> 16:21.130
<i>Did they pass?</i>

16:21.490 --> 16:23.810
<i>No, it's possible they dropped out.</i>

16:24.380 --> 16:26.910
<i>Either way, I need to keep trying.</i>

16:31.630 --> 16:34.720
<i>Next, I'll go for the yellow orb 
susceptible to magic attacks.</i>

16:35.030 --> 16:38.020
<i>I'll start by weakening myself using Kai.</i>

16:38.950 --> 16:42.630
<i>Then I'll adjust the power so it's 
neither too strong nor too weak,</i>

16:42.630 --> 16:45.400
<i>focus all my attention on it, and...</i>

16:45.610 --> 16:46.320
<i>Weak Brid.</i>

16:50.300 --> 16:51.690
Yes!

16:52.020 --> 16:55.110
I've still got one day left. 
I think I'm gonna make it!

17:00.940 --> 17:02.830
My first meal since yesterday.

17:04.940 --> 17:07.540
<i>Someone new appeared this time.</i>

17:07.790 --> 17:10.730
<i>Can examinees join partway through the test?</i>

17:11.140 --> 17:14.320
<i>As long as they don't bother me,
 I guess it doesn't matter.</i>

17:18.970 --> 17:21.690
What a refreshing morning.

17:22.200 --> 17:25.880
<i>But there's an obviously suspicious 
guy dressed in black.</i>

17:28.120 --> 17:29.550
<i>They were pretending to be asleep?</i>

17:29.940 --> 17:33.410
<i>They vanished. Did they use 
a spell to hide themselves?</i>

17:33.740 --> 17:36.920
<i>I know exactly where they are 
thanks to my Kai, though.</i>

17:36.920 --> 17:38.320
<i>I should put some distance between us...</i>

17:39.990 --> 17:41.010
<i>Crap!</i>

17:51.570 --> 17:55.340
<i>Don't think that's enough to harm me.</i>

17:55.340 --> 17:56.060
Huh?

17:56.060 --> 18:00.260
<i>My hand is cut. Not only that, 
but this looks like poison.</i>

18:00.470 --> 18:03.190
<i>How embarrassing. I'll have 
to wash it thoroughly later.</i>

18:03.190 --> 18:04.430
You bastard...

18:05.200 --> 18:07.660
<i>Are you targeting the examinees?</i>

18:07.660 --> 18:11.500
Yeah. The others have already left.

18:11.500 --> 18:14.370
I wasn't too enthused about being 
hired just to threaten you,

18:14.890 --> 18:17.440
but you'll pay for breaking my blade.

18:17.440 --> 18:19.280
<i>Are you trying to kill me?</i>

18:19.490 --> 18:21.400
You're already finished.

18:21.400 --> 18:25.200
This blade is coated with a fast-acting 
poison guaranteed to kill.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.870
<i>Fast-acting?</i>

18:26.870 --> 18:29.130
Poi...son...

18:29.650 --> 18:32.240
You neutralized that poison? Impossible!

18:32.880 --> 18:37.710
<i>If you tell me who you are and who 
hired you, I'll tell you how I did it.</i>

18:37.960 --> 18:42.300
Unfortunately, I don't have 
any contact with the client

18:42.300 --> 18:45.110
when I get jobs through the assassins' guild.

18:45.330 --> 18:46.520
<i>I see.</i>

18:46.520 --> 18:50.180
<i>I'm starting to get the sense I shouldn't 
stick my nose where it doesn't belong.</i>

18:50.180 --> 18:51.830
A wise choice.

18:52.350 --> 18:53.390
I can't move!

18:53.950 --> 18:56.800
<i>I've temporarily paralyzed 
you from the neck down.</i>

18:56.800 --> 18:58.610
<i>You're interfering with my exam. Begone.</i>

18:58.910 --> 19:01.500
I can't leave if I can't move!

19:01.770 --> 19:03.220
<i>He's not wrong.</i>

19:04.020 --> 19:06.070
<i>I'll tell you how I did it for free.</i>

19:06.070 --> 19:08.580
<i>Apparently, I'm immune to poisons.</i>

19:09.010 --> 19:10.200
<i>It's an ability I gained recently.</i>

19:10.200 --> 19:12.880
D-Don't give me that sh—

19:13.880 --> 19:15.180
What are you doing?!

19:15.530 --> 19:17.720
Why are you running this wa—

19:21.870 --> 19:23.480
Back to the exam.

19:23.480 --> 19:25.420
Let's finish this quickly so I can leave.

19:32.350 --> 19:37.630
<i>I can't perform pure physical attacks 
because my body constantly releases mana.</i>

19:37.630 --> 19:40.870
<i>The bow I borrowed is 
imbued with magic, too.</i>

19:42.290 --> 19:43.070
I know!

19:43.410 --> 19:45.650
I borrowed this knife to butcher fish.

19:45.650 --> 19:46.910
This should work.

19:47.370 --> 19:52.210
<i>It's a bit smelly, but I'll hit it with 
the back so I don't cut it in half.</i>

19:54.950 --> 19:56.080
<i>It didn't explode.</i>

19:56.860 --> 19:58.310
<i>It teleported,</i>

19:59.050 --> 20:00.520
<i>but I'll finish it off with this.</i>

20:10.110 --> 20:13.000
That took forever!

20:13.000 --> 20:14.980
Farewell, nameless wilderness!

20:14.980 --> 20:18.730
I'll never forget the suffering 
I endured these past three days!

20:24.940 --> 20:26.920
<i>Whoa, they're waiting for me.</i>

20:27.760 --> 20:31.110
Kuzunoha-san, are you 
dropping out like they did?

20:31.420 --> 20:34.320
<i>Did the man in black threaten them?</i>

20:34.920 --> 20:36.880
<i>I gathered the orbs, of course.</i>

20:36.880 --> 20:37.550
What?

20:37.950 --> 20:39.480
A-Allow me to confirm.

20:39.970 --> 20:41.010
I don't believe it.

20:41.270 --> 20:44.470
<i>I brought back three of each orb.</i>

20:44.470 --> 20:49.310
When I said three, I meant 
three of the same color.

20:49.840 --> 20:54.530
Normally people return with three of the 
color susceptible to their best attack,

20:54.810 --> 20:56.970
but you brought back all three colors?

20:56.970 --> 20:58.040
<i>What?</i>

20:58.040 --> 21:02.550
No one's ever passed the 
exam like this before.

21:03.200 --> 21:06.660
<b>Komoe</b>

21:04.510 --> 21:05.370
And so...

21:06.670 --> 21:11.660
I had to go through a lot, but they've 
hired me as a temporary instructor.

21:11.660 --> 21:13.580
Good work, Young Master.

21:14.280 --> 21:16.570
We have some time until the 
next step in the process.

21:16.570 --> 21:19.560
Why don't we check out that 
hot pot restaurant sometime?

21:19.560 --> 21:22.300
You mean Gotetsu? I look forward to it.

21:22.570 --> 21:25.040
I wonder if they serve shamonabe.

21:25.890 --> 21:28.530
<i>And so, unexpectedly, I became a teacher.</i>

21:28.530 --> 21:33.140
<i>My life at the academy 
city began thusly, but...</i>

21:35.330 --> 21:37.750
That's never happened before.

21:37.750 --> 21:41.820
No one was supposed to pass this time.

21:42.130 --> 21:44.890
What do you mean by that?

21:44.890 --> 21:47.460
Someone made a request.

21:47.460 --> 21:50.070
They said we have enough 
practical skill teachers

21:50.070 --> 21:53.400
and wanted to increase the 
difficulty of the exam.

21:53.710 --> 21:58.000
And he gathered all three colors 
anyway. I can't believe it!

21:58.610 --> 21:59.590
I see.

22:00.140 --> 22:02.250
How very interesting.

23:35.650 --> 23:39.560
Night Five: "The Lesson Will Now Begin."

23:35.890 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Time</b>

23:36.890 --> 23:39.970
<b>The Lesson Will Now Begin</b>
